  "question": {
    "text": "Sum of the squares of all integral values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which the inequality <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mi>x</mi> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mi>a</mi> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mn>0 </mn> </mrow> </math> is satisfied for all&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> <mo>∈</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mn>2</mn>&nbsp;</mrow></mfenced></mrow></math> must be equal to"
